# Standalone launcher for eigen-edit.
#
#   make gfx -C <EigenScript>        # once, to get a gfx-capable build
#   eigenscript main.eigs            # opens the editor window
#
# The editor logic lives in edit.eigs as a pure, importable buffer core;
# this file is just the front-end that opens a window and hands control
# to edit.run. Type to insert, arrows/home/end to move, backspace/delete
# to erase, Enter for a new line, Escape (or the window close box) to quit.
import edit

edit.run of null
